{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_slchan_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_slchan_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"新的高峰","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_slchan_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"155fd77ad477f38c73efe4d242d473330c13bf0c721d06495e2687ec717d4d8f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g20_skyblue_R1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿——咻，還差一步！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我跳！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"著陸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這塊岩壁還滿有挑戰性的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡差不多已經到山腰了吧，先休息一下，然後往山頂攀登好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？那邊是……煙？這種基本沒有人會來的地方，還是大白天，怎麼會有人生火？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，難道是求救訊號？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，腿傷成這樣，柴火也不好收集，這樣的荒郊野嶺，但願會有獵人什麼的路過看到吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還得小心別引來野獸……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別緊張，我是來附近登山的，看到這裡有煙，猜是不是求救訊號，就過來看一看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的有人來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的腿受傷了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這裡的山太陡峭了，我不小心摔了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，為什麼會有薩科塔在這裡爬山？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣的，我是公證所的執行者，正在執行一名死者的遺囑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遺囑上提到要找到一位多年前離開拉特蘭的薩科塔，而我一路調查，得知他就住在附近的山上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"於是我就想在附近找一找，結果……如你所見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們公證所也真是夠辛苦的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，你知道公證所嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你應該聽說過羅德島吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島——啊，費德里科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你們也真是夠辛苦的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，還好吧，我覺得送葬人挺有意思的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你別跟他一起出任務，那確實挺有意思的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，能麻煩你送我到山下的鎮上裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要在那裡休整一下，然後繼續執行遺囑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還要繼續執行任務嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，來，扶住我的手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩科塔，還是來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，薩瑪拉小姐，我以前就有點好奇了，公證所的人，感覺和我們羅德島的幹員差不多忙，整天要跑東跑西的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼要為離開的人做到這個地步呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為即使他們離開了拉特蘭，律法也始終將我們聯繫在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"律法……就像《耶拉岡德》一樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《耶拉岡德》？啊，我早該看出來了，你來自謝拉格，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，對我們謝拉格人來說，是對耶拉岡德的信仰把我們聯繫在一起的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……其中或許有些微的不同，據我所知，耶拉岡德的信徒相信耶拉岡德在冥冥之中庇護著生活在謝拉格的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我們拉特蘭人所信仰的，是律法本身，我們相信有一種規則把我們聯繫在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們對彼此負責，我們愛護彼此，我們理解彼此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以才會有公證所的誕生，因為我們願意為同胞付出，也相信這是我們每個人的義務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶拉岡德的信徒彼此之間也會互相關照，不過我們的表達會更加含蓄，因為我們相信，耶拉岡德已經替我們安排好了一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，原來耶拉岡德的信徒是這樣想的嗎，真有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這還是我第一次真正接觸耶拉岡德信仰，要是有時間，真想和你坐下來好好聊一聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我還有任務在身，謝謝你送我到這裡，恩希亞小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我完成遺囑之後有機會，我們再——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於這份遺囑，你能詳細說給我聽嗎，說不定我能幫上忙呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這附近的山都很陡峭，要是不小心的話，說不定還會受傷的。我比較擅長登山，應該能幫上忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然啦，要是是什麼比較機密的事情就算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒也並不是那麼需要保密的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，會不會太麻煩你了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事沒事，我的外派任務已經完成了，距離集合返回本艦還有一小段時間，現在可以自由活動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然我也不會來這裡登山啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，那我就恭敬不如從命了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣的，我們有一位德高望重的銃騎，雷吉斯閣下，前陣子壽終正寢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他留下了遺囑，希望公證所找到四十年前與他訣別，離開了拉特蘭的弟弟，學者林吉斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"訣別？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"由於年代久遠，恐怕只有兩位當事人知道實際情況了。我們知道的只有，他們當時因為對待戰爭的態度不同而產生了分歧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而教宗閣下當時更為偏向雷吉斯閣下的意見，最後林吉斯閣下選擇了自我流放，遠走他鄉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷吉斯閣下知道只要有自己在，林吉斯閣下絕不會返回拉特蘭，所以才希望在自己死後林吉斯閣下能返回拉特蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果林吉斯閣下也……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於這一點，遺囑上也有說明，他希望至少帶回林吉斯閣下的信物，與他葬在一起，讓他們能兄弟團聚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓曾經分道揚鑣的兄弟團聚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然這樣，我就更要幫忙了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼更加具體的線索嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我之前打聽過，這附近的人都和林吉斯閣下不是很熟，只有一個叫蒂亞娜的獵人似乎和他有過接觸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我並沒有找到這個人，所以才會去附近的山頭碰碰運氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個獵人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……這樣就可以解釋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）你受傷了所以沒有察覺到也很正常，我們一路上都在被人跟蹤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）我還以為是盯上我們的強盜，現在看來……很可能就是你說的那個獵人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）低頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在這裡等我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去追！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的訊號……和附近的移動城市可以連通嗎，太好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我，執行者薩瑪拉，請求援助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"公證所執行者","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，樞機？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爬上山了，好敏捷的身手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不過，要比爬山，我可不會輸！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，站住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是蒂亞娜，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是個路過的獵人罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別裝啦，如果你只是路過，怎麼會跟我們這麼久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你肯定是從一開始就知道薩瑪拉小姐是來幹什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……等等，你是薩卡茲？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是又怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲怎麼會——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身手還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，是你的準頭不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（等等，她不是在瞄準我。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（難道說——！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘶，好痛——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好深的陷阱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"從一開始就在把我往陷阱上引嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不止，我看你還挺擅長爬山的，順便把你的登山裝備也卸了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"薩卡茲獵人探出頭，向崖心揮了揮她隨身攜帶的背包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼時候！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，我沒打算殺了你。等會我就去鎮裡告訴自衛隊，說有人在山上遇到危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的背包之類的我也會寄存在那，等救援的人來了，拿回你的東西就滾吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼要這麼做？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的要求很簡單，小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去告訴公證所的人，林吉斯不會回拉特蘭的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，要是我多留個心眼就好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦……這個籠子還有尖刺……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，這裡原本應該是一個捕獸陷阱，偷獵者最喜歡佈置這樣的陷阱等獵物自己送上門來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是這裡面的尖刺都被拆掉了，她剛才也說，她沒打算害死我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些應該是她拆掉的吧，用來應付今天這種可能發生的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是這樣的話……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個菲林看起來還蠻結實的，困在那裡一時半會應該死不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趕快去把老頭子的東西收拾收拾，然後跟鎮上報信吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，真是麻煩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陷阱裡殘留的那些機關足夠作為支點讓我爬上來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個距離，你的弩比不過我的鉤爪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想要見林吉斯閣下一面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他不會見你的，滾回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那就別怪我不客氣了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，小心，那邊的岩石很不穩固！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓住我的鉤爪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放開，你撐不住的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能拋下你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡，既然拉不上來的話……準備好接受衝擊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你應該鬆開我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有打算殺了我，我當然也不想看著你送死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有這麼算的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛才說薩卡茲沒有那個意思，我只是有點驚訝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不怪你，任何人聽到都會驚訝的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該知道他有個哥哥——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷吉斯，現在他哥哥死了，想讓他回拉特蘭，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他不會回去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都幾十年過去了，現在才想起來找他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，這畢竟是雷吉斯閣下最後的心願——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且親人之間，就算有再深的隔閡，也一定有化解的辦法的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你憑什麼這麼覺得？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的哥哥姐姐，因為有些事情關係也不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但、但是，他們終究是兄妹，他們之間，只是缺少了一個能夠讓彼此敞開心扉談一談的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己都說得沒那麼肯定，還想說服我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為要是連我都放棄這麼想了，那我們一家人，就真的再也沒辦法坐在一起了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我是知道的，哥哥和姐姐心裡一直想著對方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你再怎麼努力也沒用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林吉斯他……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早就死了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，灰塵好多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他死後，我就沒有再來過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和他——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道我的父母是誰，是鎮上裡一個乞丐把我養大的，算是我爸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鎮裡的人不壞，但沒人願意收養一個薩卡茲，等我爸死了，我就開始靠打獵維生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一次在山裡遇到個大傢伙，本來以為自己要死了，結果一個路過的薩科塔老頭救了我一命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他把肉分了我一些，還說我的箭術臭得像坨屎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實……我到現在都記得，他把我救下來後，看著我愣了一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一開始不明白是為什麼，很久以後我才知道，他看出了我是薩卡茲，他那時就想殺了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我只是個在鄉下長大的野孩子，我那時可不知道這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，就算現在我也不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打我生下來我就沒見過薩科塔，我也不明白為什麼要去恨這些頭頂光環的傢伙，鎮子上的老爺們要討人厭多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……歷史總是很複雜的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看不出來你還挺有學問的，和臭老頭說了一樣的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就當作你在誇我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正，我覺得他蠻厲害的，就想請他教我箭術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他並不想讓我靠近他，每次我想靠近，他都會用銃把我趕走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在想來也是有點好笑，我不知道他動了幾次殺心，但那時的我不明白，甚至以為他在逗我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果到最後，他大概也是煩了，我們形成了一種默契，我到他家附近躲著，他會故意露兩手給我看，算是教我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那他——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三年前，附近來了一伙薩卡茲盜匪，他們看到我是薩卡茲，身手也不錯，就想要籠絡我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拒絕了他們，他們就把我綁架了，想要逼我就範。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果臭老頭一個人跑來救我，最後，我活了下來，他卻——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多年，他從沒認過我這個學生，我想，他應該根本不願意認一個薩卡茲當學生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但沒有他教我的本領，我早就死在這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，他從沒離開過這裡，也沒有人來找過他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在他的兄弟想要讓他回拉特蘭？就算是他的遺物，我也不同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他不屬於拉特蘭，他屬於這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是你能理解的話，就放棄吧，否則的話，我不介意在這裡把你解決掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以在屋子裡到處看看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……隨便。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些書籍是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老頭子還蠻喜歡讀書的，這些書都是他自己找來的，本來想教我，看我實在讀不進去，就放棄了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些書……都是關於薩卡茲和薩科塔的歷史——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上面還有很詳細的批註……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？這裡有一張紙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是一封……信？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷吉斯，正因為我們是至親的兄弟，我們之間才無法因為共感而達成讓步，因為這意味著對彼此的侮辱。\n只是，現在回想起來，當時我是不是有更好的做法，而不是一走了之？我想，或許是有的。\n但我們應該都不後悔彼此所做的選擇。\n而且我們做出了選擇，也不代表著另一個選擇就永遠失去了價值。\n我正是為此而選擇離開拉特蘭的。\n我想，我此生應該不會返回拉特蘭了。\n但我會懷念你做的草莓奶昔的。\n——林吉斯"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亞娜小姐，你看這個。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林吉斯……並不恨雷吉斯，也不恨拉特蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他只是做出了選擇，並且為了自己的選擇而不再返回拉特蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那又怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼樣，他不還是沒打算回拉特蘭嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這和回不回拉特蘭沒有關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們兄弟之間並沒有隔閡，就是這麼簡單的事，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"許多人在知道薩科塔可以依靠共感來共享情緒之後，會下意識地以為薩科塔之間不存在矛盾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事實上絕不是這樣的，共享情緒只是能夠讓你得知對方是出於怎樣的心情提出想法的，這並不意味著你就要理解並同意對方的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，在一些小事上，薩科塔之間是可以透過共感來達成和解或者讓步的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，在一些重大事務上，薩科塔之間也有無法退讓的界線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這些事務上，薩科塔之間最終能夠達成的共識是“彼此之間無法互相理解”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是誰？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教皇廳樞機，薇爾麗芙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"樞機？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"銃騎雷吉斯是我十分尊敬的長者。我剛好在拜訪附近的城市，聽說他的遺囑在執行上遇到困難，自然要過來看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本我都打算直接出手了，沒想到有人幫我解決了這樣一樁麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必過度緊張，我在門外稍微聽了一會二位的交談，看起來事情已經解決了，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰告訴你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"銃騎雷吉斯與他的弟弟學者林吉斯之間的分歧，出在對待戰爭的態度上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"薇爾麗芙抬起手，將黑洞洞的銃口對準了薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……混帳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別以為你可以為所欲為，薩科塔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"蒂亞娜也不甘示弱地舉起弩，對準了薩科塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對於戰爭，雷吉斯閣下與教宗閣下選擇了更加溫和的態度，而林吉斯閣下則抱持較為主動和激進的觀點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這導致了兩人最後分道揚鑣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷吉斯閣下的遺囑中要求，如果林吉斯閣下已經死亡，那麼需要將他的信物帶回拉特蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，信物裡並不包括一個薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是一個普通的登山家能夠插足的事，小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以請羅德島收留她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我沒記錯的話，羅德島的原則是不主動插足國家事務——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然很難評價這條原則被執行的程度，但是，這趟渾水我想他們應該是不願意蹚的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我可以讓她去……去謝拉格！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？謝拉格？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希亞小姐，您要想清楚，在這裡使用您的姓氏，希瓦艾什，會帶來什麼影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……您從一開始就知道我是誰，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不否認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然您知道我的姓氏，想必也知道我的哥哥姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蔓珠院聖女恩雅，喀蘭貿易總裁恩希歐迪斯，這兩個名字，如今已經越來越為人所知了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在我心裡，他們始終只是我的哥哥姐姐，是因為哥哥的選擇，十年來沒有再私下一起吃過一頓飯的兄妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我心裡多多少少也明白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像這對兄弟一樣，哥哥和姐姐之間並不是不能互相理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恰恰相反，他們理解對方不會放棄自己的堅持，理解彼此的立場，理解有些事只有對方才能做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以他們是不可能回到從前的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白，但我就是沒辦法放棄這個想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而就在剛才，我得知了有一對薩科塔兄弟，他們也面臨著相似的處境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們理解著彼此的無法理解，他們選擇了分道揚鑣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在生命的最後一刻，他們的心中依然想著彼此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這確實很感人，但是這對於阻止我的意義是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥哥和姐姐之間的互相理解，並不只是單純地去包容對方的行為，更重要的是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們相信，對方的選擇之中是有正確之處的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"並且相信，自己的選擇終究能夠影響對方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最重要的是——他們會抵達同一個終點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說得真好，恩希亞小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"薇爾麗芙說著，放下了手中的銃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本我也只是打算嚇你兩下的，把你逼走，然後任你逃命。畢竟，在原則上，我無法對出現在我視線中的薩卡茲放任不管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然恩希亞小姐提出了更好的方案，那我自然願意遵從。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得我一定打不過你，而你從一開始就打算饒我一命？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己也這麼想，不是嗎？雖然這很困難，但請把這理解為一種善意，小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"混帳薩科塔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正如恩希亞小姐所說，雷吉斯閣下並不認為林吉斯閣下是錯誤的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是在任何一個時代，對錯都不會是決定一件事的唯一因素罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，我不會帶走這裡的所有東西，只需要一些紀念物，比如一本書，一些手稿就好，這樣你可以接受嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唉，隨你的便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，你的真誠十分動人，恩希亞小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的話讓我確信了一件事，雖然我們身處不同的信仰之中，雖然我們的生活環境並不相同，但我們面臨的問題始終是有共通之處的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯，我也這麼想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直以為薩科塔都是像能天使那樣的性格，現在我知道了，薩科塔之間也會有各種各樣的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，能夠理解這一點，將會是你真正理解拉特蘭的第一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，如果我沒記錯的話，謝拉格花費三年建造的耶拉岡德像即將落成，你應當要啟程返回謝拉格參加落成典禮了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你願意的話，我可以送你一程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於這一點，我有一個不情之請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想跟著薩瑪拉小姐四處走走，多瞭解一些拉特蘭和薩科塔的事情，可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？你不打算回去了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暫時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"經過這次的事，我算是徹底想通了，想著把他們拉在一起確實沒有意義了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定在我不在的時候，他們早就已經在一張桌子上吃過飯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然他們是能夠互相理解的，既然他們心裡都是裝著謝拉格的，既然他們最終會殊途同歸……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我也應該往前看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"樞機姐姐，你其實是為了我而來的，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒錯，從薩瑪拉告訴我你的名字，以及你和她聊的話題後，我就打算親自來一趟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然在萬國峰會打過照面了，謝拉格與拉特蘭已經建立了聯繫，但耶拉岡德信仰與拉特蘭教之間始終缺乏一個對話的契機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，就讓我來成為這個契機吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，文化上的交流，這是謝拉格現在非常需要的東西。而對教宗閣下而言，這同樣也是令人歡迎的對話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我必須最後問你一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希亞·希瓦艾什閣下，您清楚自己在做什麼，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我代表拉特蘭歡迎你，恩希亞小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不過在那之前，我需要先去附近的羅德島辦事處一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"崖心","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亞娜的去處得請他們幫我安排，還要請博士帶個口信給老哥。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
